WEBVTT

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:26.290
<b>Chaika the Coffin Princess</b>

00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:27.050
<b>Chaika the Coffin Princess</b>

00:01:31.200 --> 00:01:35.570
Those who have defeated two teams 
here will cross these bridges next.

00:01:35.570 --> 00:01:40.910
The first teams to make it across will 
be permitted inside the third wall.

00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:42.070
Chaika.

00:01:42.070 --> 00:01:42.660
Yes.

00:01:42.660 --> 00:01:43.910
Begin!

00:01:46.870 --> 00:01:50.380
The Bells of Contention

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:13.430
Chaika!

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:16.650
N-No worry!

00:02:22.590 --> 00:02:23.200
Chaika!

00:02:23.490 --> 00:02:24.540
No fear!

00:02:25.220 --> 00:02:26.190
Grab on!

00:02:27.910 --> 00:02:28.540
Come on!

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:39.130
Sheesh... I was afraid the bridges would 
collapse under your weight, Nikolai.

00:02:39.130 --> 00:02:40.420
Don't say that.

00:02:40.420 --> 00:02:42.190
But what is this?

00:02:42.190 --> 00:02:44.050
They're making fools of us.

00:02:44.050 --> 00:02:46.720
Someone out there is getting 
a kick out of this.

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:50.980
When I get my hands on Hartgen, 
I'll be sure to repay him for this.

00:02:54.560 --> 00:02:55.770
Stop!

00:02:56.310 --> 00:02:57.480
What?

00:02:57.480 --> 00:02:59.330
You two have violated the rules.

00:02:59.330 --> 00:03:01.430
Your right to participate will be revoked.

00:03:01.430 --> 00:03:02.850
Violated the rules?!

00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:04.730
Rules in a killing match?

00:03:04.730 --> 00:03:06.290
It's not a free-for-all?

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:10.000
Enough jokes! You two have 
lied about your identities!

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:14.000
We know you're with the 
Kliemann Organization.

00:03:19.140 --> 00:03:21.010
Keep walking that way.

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:29.120
They're not going to just let us leave?

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:30.930
What are they making us do?

00:03:30.930 --> 00:03:32.980
I don't know, but it doesn't matter.

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:36.280
It got us into the castle.

00:03:45.110 --> 00:03:48.670
Does this really go all the 
way to the top of the castle?

00:03:48.670 --> 00:03:51.580
Yes. According to Chaika's magic probe,

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:54.280
it's likely the remains 
are on the highest level.

00:04:15.910 --> 00:04:18.080
Come, strained atmosphere!

00:04:18.080 --> 00:04:19.440
The Tense Air!

00:04:21.970 --> 00:04:23.220
Victory!

00:04:26.720 --> 00:04:27.990
Come this way.

00:04:34.260 --> 00:04:35.490
What is this?

00:04:35.490 --> 00:04:37.960
You two have violated the rules.

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:38.960
Huh?!

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:42.550
We know that you and your companions 
stole into the castle last night.

00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:44.800
Toru...

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:48.600
Go. Your battlefield lies ahead.

00:04:50.410 --> 00:04:53.240
In here, what sort of arena?

00:04:53.240 --> 00:04:54.810
I don't know...

00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:57.480
But our only option is to go forward.

00:04:57.750 --> 00:04:58.650
Yes.

00:05:04.310 --> 00:05:05.610
Toru...

00:05:05.610 --> 00:05:06.610
What?

00:05:06.940 --> 00:05:11.130
Niva's true identity, Father's fortune.

00:05:11.130 --> 00:05:14.630
But Father's goal, do what?

00:05:14.630 --> 00:05:16.620
Accomplish what?

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:19.380
If he left behind a Gundo that powerful,

00:05:19.380 --> 00:05:22.050
Emperor Gaz may have wanted

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:26.040
to bring war to this world 
even after his death.

00:05:26.900 --> 00:05:29.950
Maybe he thought the Gundo 
just needed to get to someone

00:05:29.950 --> 00:05:31.990
who wanted to start a war, like Hartgen.

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:36.040
If that's the case, then his 
goal has been realized.

00:05:36.860 --> 00:05:40.020
Want war... Toru same?

00:05:40.020 --> 00:05:41.150
Huh?

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:43.150
War is fine with me!

00:05:43.150 --> 00:05:46.860
Why don't we let her bring 
back the age of war?

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:51.790
I...

00:05:53.400 --> 00:05:55.810
Chaika, how do you feel?

00:05:56.350 --> 00:05:58.930
What if that is what the emperor wants?

00:05:59.560 --> 00:06:01.670
Not want war.

00:06:02.470 --> 00:06:05.760
I see. That's what you think?

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:06.770
Yes.

00:06:08.170 --> 00:06:11.030
I'll keep your words in mind.

00:06:11.360 --> 00:06:12.290
Yes.

00:06:24.680 --> 00:06:27.540
Come, silence which speaks not.

00:06:27.540 --> 00:06:29.080
The Silencer!

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:32.870
Come, crusher of air!

00:06:37.590 --> 00:06:41.300
Most of the guards are currently acting 
as security for the tournament.

00:06:41.300 --> 00:06:42.320
Now's our chance.

00:06:42.860 --> 00:06:44.650
You are from the Kliemann Organization!

00:06:45.820 --> 00:06:49.590
I am a retainer to King Hartgen...

00:06:49.590 --> 00:06:53.100
Or, I used to be.

00:06:54.870 --> 00:06:57.630
What is King Hartgen trying to do?

00:06:58.080 --> 00:07:01.260
You may think I'm talking nonsense,

00:07:01.880 --> 00:07:05.320
but the king wants to become 
the second Emperor Gaz.

00:07:06.620 --> 00:07:12.070
It was as if the king was possessed 
by Gaz after he killed him.

00:07:12.440 --> 00:07:16.560
He investigated, in depth, how Gaz 
was trying to seize the continent,

00:07:16.560 --> 00:07:21.290
and what sort of army he 
was trying to raise.

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:25.840
Eventually, it led him to gather soldiers 
for this martial arts tournament.

00:07:26.900 --> 00:07:30.360
King Hartgen intends to start a war.

00:07:30.360 --> 00:07:34.240
The king changed completely 
after the war ended.

00:07:34.810 --> 00:07:39.260
And when that person arrived at the 
castle, it only spurred him on.

00:07:39.260 --> 00:07:40.600
What person?

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:42.480
Chaika.

00:07:50.190 --> 00:07:51.000
Your Majesty!

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:52.370
Welcome back!

00:07:52.370 --> 00:07:53.740
Thank goodness you're safe!

00:07:54.600 --> 00:07:55.570
Your Majesty?

00:07:59.910 --> 00:08:02.930
"There is no value in peace.

00:08:02.930 --> 00:08:06.440
Song and verse offer no comfort.

00:08:07.170 --> 00:08:09.860
My soul is only satisfied by

00:08:09.860 --> 00:08:13.520
the roar of the battlefield and 
the smell of blood," he said.

00:08:14.090 --> 00:08:18.990
It was then that Chaika appeared before him.

00:08:21.450 --> 00:08:24.470
<i>If you will give me the 
remains of the emperor,</i>

00:08:24.470 --> 00:08:27.400
<i>I will bring change to 
your days of monotony.</i>

00:08:30.270 --> 00:08:33.280
<i>Gather strong men to this castle.</i>

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:35.990
<i>They will be the face of your power.</i>

00:08:36.920 --> 00:08:41.120
That girl proposed that he hold 
a martial arts tournament

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:44.480
with Emperor Gaz's remains 
offered to the winner.

00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:50.490
At first, no one believed the 
king would listen to her.

00:08:50.490 --> 00:08:56.190
But, against our expectations, 
he began to do just as Chaika said.

00:08:56.840 --> 00:09:00.310
All of his retainers ended up as I have.

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:01.560
They were sent away?

00:09:03.110 --> 00:09:06.000
Some were even killed.

00:09:09.250 --> 00:09:12.090
I cannot remain in the castle any longer.

00:09:12.570 --> 00:09:14.990
Please stop the king.

00:09:20.900 --> 00:09:24.720
So the black Chaika was pulling 
the strings behind the scenes.

00:09:25.800 --> 00:09:27.470
I'll stay in the castle.

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:31.150
Would you two go back to 
our meeting point for now?

00:09:31.810 --> 00:09:34.690
I want to find out where Vivi 
and Captain Nikolai are, too.

00:09:34.690 --> 00:09:35.670
Right.

00:09:46.240 --> 00:09:47.280
Chaika.

00:09:52.400 --> 00:09:54.380
The plan is going perfectly.

00:09:54.380 --> 00:09:57.570
Soon, all the remains will be together.

00:09:58.290 --> 00:10:00.930
I'm glad, Father.

00:10:01.470 --> 00:10:04.410
It's all thanks to you, Chaika.

00:10:05.020 --> 00:10:09.380
You gave me a reason to live again.

00:10:14.930 --> 00:10:18.130
They don't have a clue. Poor things.

00:10:23.290 --> 00:10:25.350
I can smell the remains.

00:10:30.730 --> 00:10:32.150
What is this?

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:35.420
So many of them...

00:10:47.540 --> 00:10:48.660
Chaikas?

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:52.250
They want to fight?

00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:08.090
Fredrica, count to three and shut the door!

00:11:08.090 --> 00:11:09.140
Got it!

00:11:09.450 --> 00:11:10.440
One...

00:11:10.980 --> 00:11:12.400
Two...

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:13.730
Three!

00:11:16.030 --> 00:11:17.740
Whoops! Did I get her?

00:11:17.740 --> 00:11:19.800
They're puppets.

00:11:19.800 --> 00:11:22.680
Oh, good. That wasn't yours.

00:11:22.680 --> 00:11:24.020
Let's hurry.

00:11:44.010 --> 00:11:46.010
We've been waiting for you.

00:11:48.290 --> 00:11:50.430
Shock... Chaikas?!

00:11:50.430 --> 00:11:51.600
Three of them?

00:11:54.800 --> 00:11:56.950
So, we finally meet.

00:11:56.950 --> 00:12:00.800
I can't forgive people who do bad things.

00:12:01.910 --> 00:12:05.050
Yes, this is where you will atone.

00:12:07.900 --> 00:12:10.790
What are they going to make us do?

00:12:22.360 --> 00:12:23.530
Nikolai...

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:31.450
Gillette-sama?

00:12:34.200 --> 00:12:35.300
Captain...

00:12:35.960 --> 00:12:37.690
Is it you, Captain?

00:12:38.800 --> 00:12:40.220
Are you ready?

00:12:46.620 --> 00:12:48.030
Chief Konrad.

00:12:48.900 --> 00:12:50.180
Prime Minister Berman and

00:12:50.180 --> 00:12:52.520
Minister Moscaetz of the 
Alliance of the Six Nations

00:12:52.520 --> 00:12:54.950
have independently dispatched the

00:12:54.950 --> 00:12:57.970
floating fortress Cima to 
the Principality of Hartgen.

00:13:05.230 --> 00:13:07.680
That one is only half Chaika.

00:13:08.100 --> 00:13:11.780
And she won't even acknowledge 
that she is Chaika.

00:13:11.780 --> 00:13:14.660
She didn't even attempt 
to gather the remains.

00:13:14.660 --> 00:13:16.170
What a bore.

00:13:31.990 --> 00:13:33.250
Gillette-sama...

00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:40.640
Is this really the captain?!

00:13:40.640 --> 00:13:41.590
It is Gillette-sama!

00:13:54.610 --> 00:13:57.180
Why are you fighting us?!

00:13:57.180 --> 00:13:59.660
Because that is my job!

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:04.160
Vivi, fight him for real!

00:14:04.570 --> 00:14:06.700
Otherwise, we'll be killed!

00:14:11.150 --> 00:14:14.620
Have you forgotten?! 
We're your subordinates!

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:16.760
What are you talking about?!

00:14:17.450 --> 00:14:21.170
You really don't remember us?!

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:23.340
Do you know how worried we all were?!

00:14:27.340 --> 00:14:29.050
Vivi! This is not him!

00:14:37.160 --> 00:14:38.790
Stop, Captain!

00:14:40.270 --> 00:14:42.980
I don't... I don't know you!

00:14:42.980 --> 00:14:44.730
That's not true! You're Gillette-sama!

00:14:45.730 --> 00:14:48.450
Try to remember, Gillette-sama!

00:15:15.770 --> 00:15:17.540
Gillette-sama...

00:15:20.680 --> 00:15:21.560
Vivi?

00:15:23.570 --> 00:15:24.690
Yes.

00:15:28.100 --> 00:15:29.190
Gillette-sama!

00:15:29.710 --> 00:15:30.780
Captain!

00:15:32.560 --> 00:15:33.860
How boring.

00:15:33.860 --> 00:15:35.450
What a farce.

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:38.450
To say I misjudged him is an understatement.

00:15:38.880 --> 00:15:42.250
And he was supposed to make 
her atone for her sins.

00:15:52.380 --> 00:15:54.000
We have to stop the bleeding!

00:15:55.550 --> 00:15:58.180
Gillette-sama... I'm sorry.

00:15:58.180 --> 00:16:01.060
No. I should be the one to apologize.

00:16:02.160 --> 00:16:03.690
We'll talk later.

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:05.270
We have to get out of here, Vivi!

00:16:05.270 --> 00:16:06.140
Yes!

00:16:12.840 --> 00:16:14.200
Brother Shin...

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:15.490
So you're here, Akari.

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:17.780
Did you come to find the remains?

00:16:18.270 --> 00:16:21.450
Too bad. They're no longer here.

00:16:21.450 --> 00:16:23.250
You think I'll believe what you say?

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:29.600
Fredrica!

00:16:34.130 --> 00:16:36.550
We've sealed the dragoon's power.

00:16:37.010 --> 00:16:38.100
What now?

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:58.430
Which do you two think will win?

00:16:58.430 --> 00:17:00.850
I think it'll be the red one.

00:17:00.850 --> 00:17:03.120
Then I'll say the white one.

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:06.440
Always wait for this chance.

00:17:06.440 --> 00:17:08.920
Will take all remains now!

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:09.750
Can't!

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:10.630
No!

00:17:11.430 --> 00:17:16.260
Proposal. Gather remains, 
then father's funeral, together.

00:17:16.530 --> 00:17:20.150
Refuse. Absolutely refuse your proposal!

00:17:20.150 --> 00:17:21.470
Objective, different!

00:17:21.470 --> 00:17:23.650
Objective, different?

00:17:23.650 --> 00:17:25.530
Explain objective!

00:17:26.410 --> 00:17:27.660
Revenge.

00:17:29.010 --> 00:17:32.110
No matter! No need explain!

00:17:32.500 --> 00:17:35.240
Will take all remains! That is all!

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:38.630
Chaika, we have to take her on. Be ready.

00:17:38.630 --> 00:17:39.700
Right.

00:17:41.160 --> 00:17:42.870
I am steel.

00:17:42.870 --> 00:17:46.880
Steel knows no fear. Steel knows no doubt.

00:17:46.880 --> 00:17:50.340
When faced with my enemy, I hesitate not.

00:17:50.740 --> 00:17:52.940
I am a weapon to destroy these.

00:17:54.090 --> 00:17:55.300
Iron-Blood Transformation!

00:18:11.020 --> 00:18:12.270
The Burster!

00:18:22.720 --> 00:18:23.560
Sorry.

00:18:23.560 --> 00:18:24.660
No need concern!

00:18:25.170 --> 00:18:27.790
Come, strained atmosphere!

00:18:27.790 --> 00:18:28.920
The Tense Air!

00:18:31.320 --> 00:18:32.090
Will defeat!

00:18:37.340 --> 00:18:38.590
David!

00:18:38.930 --> 00:18:41.180
Come, to strike and crush!

00:18:39.410 --> 00:18:40.370
Damn...

00:18:41.180 --> 00:18:42.680
The Slugger!

00:18:59.350 --> 00:19:01.200
Ow...

00:19:07.050 --> 00:19:09.160
Declare loss.

00:19:10.440 --> 00:19:12.030
Hey, come on!

00:19:12.030 --> 00:19:14.480
We can keep going! Don't give up!

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:16.260
Fine.

00:19:17.250 --> 00:19:18.780
I also have

00:19:19.340 --> 00:19:20.900
something to protect.

00:19:23.350 --> 00:19:25.020
Don't...

00:19:25.020 --> 00:19:26.560
I quit.

00:19:28.430 --> 00:19:30.790
I lose.

00:19:31.820 --> 00:19:33.040
Hey!

00:19:37.200 --> 00:19:40.360
Dear Sister, what shall 
we do with the red one?

00:19:40.900 --> 00:19:42.850
Just leave her.

00:19:42.850 --> 00:19:45.700
Yes. She's no longer needed.

00:19:46.460 --> 00:19:49.120
What are they gonna make us do next?

00:19:49.120 --> 00:19:51.430
Chaika, have your Gundo ready.

00:19:51.430 --> 00:19:52.370
Right.

00:19:53.380 --> 00:19:55.070
How's it going here?

00:19:55.070 --> 00:19:57.210
Just as I expected.

00:19:57.210 --> 00:20:01.800
So the one who gathered the 
most remains won, then?

00:20:02.520 --> 00:20:03.510
Shin!

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:20.090
Yes.

00:20:38.630 --> 00:20:40.010
Toru!

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:49.640
Isn't this the one I gave 
you a long time ago?

00:20:50.110 --> 00:20:51.630
You're still using it?

00:20:53.140 --> 00:20:55.330
You never change, Toru.

00:20:56.320 --> 00:20:58.810
You're still not cut out to be a saboteur.

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:06.700
Because you're so quick 
to act on your emotions!

00:21:13.430 --> 00:21:14.720
Toru!

00:21:16.240 --> 00:21:19.100
Hand over all of the remains that you have.

00:21:19.590 --> 00:21:21.880
Do that and we'll give her back.

00:21:24.980 --> 00:21:26.220
Toru,

00:21:26.220 --> 00:21:27.990
you've lost.

00:21:30.780 --> 00:21:33.720
Just as we planned, right, Father?

00:21:33.720 --> 00:21:37.770
Yes, that's right, my most beloved daughter.

00:21:43.410 --> 00:21:44.630
Akari...

00:21:47.630 --> 00:21:48.780
Toru!

00:23:26.170 --> 00:23:29.520
The white Chaika and the red Chaika

00:23:29.520 --> 00:23:32.020
have worked so hard to gather the remains.

00:23:32.020 --> 00:23:35.990
And they had no idea it was 
all for me. Poor things.

00:23:36.680 --> 00:23:40.190
Next time: "The Throne That Invites War."

00:23:36.700 --> 00:23:40.190
The Throne That Invites War
